      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Space exploration milestones: NASA's Artemis mission successfully tested new lunar landing technology, while SpaceX launched 12 Starlink satellites and announced plans for Mars colonization by 2030. Private space companies raised $8 billion in funding this week."
